WEBVTT

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:06.610
Wh-What's the deal?!

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.570
I was just capturing your future on film.

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.570
See? It's right here.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.780
Your future has been photographed.

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:21.040
It depicts you lying on the ground after losing this Duel.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:25.080
Like hell I'll believe that bogus photo!

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:28.040
You can't change a future that's been photographed.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:32.550
That was decided the moment I flashed my shutter.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:43.890
All photos I shoot depict the future.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.230
And it is sure to... become a reality.

00:00:57.910 --> 00:01:01.990
Is that darn Shark... really Dueling for revenge?

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.870
<i>I will exact revenge on you here and now!</i>

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Yuma, don't get involved with me anymore...</i>

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:12.420
Yuma?

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:15.510
It's not just Shark... Even that IV guy...

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:19.600
<i>Such painful and twisted expressions!</i>

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:22.510
<i>It shines only during my service!</i>

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:26.310
<i>Take my fanservice!</i>

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:29.440
Dueling isn't a tool for revenge!

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:33.940
Duels aren't meant to hurt people!

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:36.530
All Duelists are friends!

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:38.160
So why?!

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:45.250
Hey, look Yuma! It's a blimp!

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:47.660
It must be a special occasion to celebrate the opening of the Carnival!

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:50.080
Maybe riding it will lift your spirits.

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:53.300
Let's look at Heartland City from up in the sky!

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:54.800
It's unacceptable! There's no excuse!

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:56.300
Hey, how about it?

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:57.630
No excuse!

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:01.640
We're supposed to be friends! We're supposed to enjoy ourselves!

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:05.060
C'mon, obviously we're all friends.

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:06.730
That's why we should cheer each other up.

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:08.690
This ain't funny!

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:12.860
Oh, gawd!

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:15.280
What're you so worried about?

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:17.070
Fine, just do whatever you want!

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:21.700
Shouldn't you go after her?

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:23.660
Kotori seems to be really worrying about you.

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:26.500
Shut up! Just keep out of it!

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:27.540
Fine then.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.580
Darn it...

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:42.200
<i>As I get closer, I stretch my hand out</i>

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:45.250
<i>towards that shining light leading towards tomorrow</i>

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:52.510
<i>I dream of a world that expands from my feet.</i>

00:02:56.260 --> 00:03:01.770
<i>I haven't a clue of where things like dreams and hopes are at.</i>

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:06.270
<i>Even if I run looking for it, I still can't seem to find it.</i>

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:12.730
<i>I wonder if I have fallen into a gap of truth and lies.</i>

00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:17.530
<i>Even so, our grand tale has yet to begin.</i>

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:23.200
<i>Let's move on towards tomorrow, 
even if our road begins to fall apart.</i>

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:28.460
<i>I will jump forward, before all my
 strength completely drains.</i>

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:31.340
<i>The closer I get, the further it becomes,</i>

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:34.630
<i>that truth that I must seize.</i>

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:39.800
<i>It's to find hope that we desire from a future unseen.</i>

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:42.390
<i>With a heart stronger than anyone else,</i>

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:45.560
<i>I'll learn to keep running up.</i>

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:51.110
<i>With the strength to win any battle, 
despite just how weak I am,</i>

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:53.610
<i>My purpose is to find,</i>

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:56.610
<i>with these invaluable friends of mine,</i>

00:03:56.610 --> 00:04:03.410
<i>The future of the world expanding
 from my feet with my own eyes.</i>

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:11.100
Shuuta Hayami?

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:15.400
Ah, that freelancer photographer you
 were talking about, editor-in-chief.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:18.570
"Number 35: The Shocking Scoop!
 Kotori's Dangerous Future!"

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:19.820
You told the guy, "It needs to have a bigger impact" and claimed he would give us a trashy reputation.

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:25.820
But lately, he's been able to capture major events on camera before any other journalists even got a chance to report on them!

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:33.160
That amateur photographer somehow managed to capture one scoop after another on film before anyone else.

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:35.790
He shocked many experts around the world!

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:38.380
You have absolutely no idea, eh?

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:44.340
I realize you have other work, but I want you to make contact with this Shuuta Hayami and collect data on him!

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.220
Huh!?

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:53.230
<i>Anyway, I want you to convince him to enter a contract with our company's monopoly!</i>

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:56.940
<i>Our sources tell us he is a participant in the Duel Carnival.</i>

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:57.900
<i>His current location is...</i>

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:02.780
God, why me?!

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:15.370
What the hell's that photo supposed to be?!

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.170
That's...

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.590
It isn't a lie.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.880
This depicts your future.

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.840
Here's the proof.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:28.850
What you see in these pictures will happen...

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:42.570
...as you can see.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:47.200
I can change the future.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:51.030
I can then reveal that future in the form of a photograph.

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:52.790
The future?

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:56.370
And that is why I will never lose in a Duel!

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:02.460
So you also didn't have a Number?

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:05.590
Wait!

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:09.300
You okay?

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:12.470
What the hell is that guy?

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:20.940
These photographs were taken before this actually happened...

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:24.230
Does that mean he can really control the future?

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:29.450
Then all the scoops he captured on film up until now...

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:50.720
<i>What were you doing? I'm in a hurry here, so answer immediately!</i>

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:53.010
Big Sis...

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:55.600
<i>You've heard of Shuuta Hayami, haven't you?</i>

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.220
Iyami?

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:58.180
No, it's Hayami!

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:00.690
You should know him if he's participating in the Carnival, shouldn't you?

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:03.110
<i>What do you take me for?</i>

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:04.610
<i>I don't know a guy like that!</i>

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.650
We can't allow him to create any more incidents.

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:10.030
Incidents? Whatcha mean by that?

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:15.280
Shuuta Hayami seems to have the power to make any future he sees in his mind become a reality.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:16.370
What's that supposed to mean?

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:20.080
I don't fully believe it 100% myself.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:23.330
But I saw him take a picture of the future.

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:26.670
And they let a guy like that into the Duel Carnival?

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:30.470
<i>I don't know why. And since I don't know why, I'm investigating.</i>

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:34.390
<i>But with that power of his, he can't lose a Duel.</i>

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:40.690
<i>Anyway, if you find Shuuta Hayami, I want you to contact me immediately!</i>

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:41.480
<i>Got it?!</i>

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.560
Gosh, what gives?

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:47.270
He won't lose because he can see the future?

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:53.530
But if there is any truth to it, there's a chance this person might be possessed by a Number.

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:55.120
By a Number?

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:57.120
This is cause for investigation.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:01.330
Yuma, go find him. This man named Shuuta Hayami.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:07.040
God, every single one of 'em ordering me around... Who do you people think you are?

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.000
Right, Kotori?

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:11.760
Huh? Where'd she go?

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:15.550
She left a while ago after you said some terrible things to her.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:16.680
Huh?!

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:18.220
You really don't remember?

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:21.430
I did that to Kotori? Like heck would I ever!

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:23.690
Kotori! Kotori?

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:33.780
<i>Observation #17: "When human beings hurt one another with their words, they have no memory of it afterward."</i>

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:36.490
Now I understand how you feel, Kotori.

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:08.400
If Yuma really wants to be by himself, I'll just go up in the sky by myself!

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:09.610
Say cheese, everyone!

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.360
Look this way! Ready!

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.070
Cheese!

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:15.240
Good! Okay!

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:17.820
Upperclassman!

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:19.660
Upperclassman Hayami!

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:24.460
Mizuki-<i>kun</i>?

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.670
It's been so long!

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:35.760
It's been about a year or so since I took that picture of you, Mizuki-<i>kun</i>.

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:38.720
Yes, and it looks so pretty!

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:43.220
Though it was a bit embarrassing when it was chosen to be shown in the arts festival.

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:44.730
But it made me happy.

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:48.150
Even now, I consider that photo to be one of my greatest works.

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:50.940
It's a very pleasant middle school memory.

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:53.320
You haven't changed.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.690
Huh? Me?

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:55.650
Yes!

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:01.580
The smiles on those kids' faces...

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:06.410
You still take such nice pictures that really bring out the charm of those in them.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:11.790
Oh yeah. Let me take a new shot using the blimp as the background.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:14.300
Sure! Of course you can!

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.870
Man, I can't believe I have to find this guy.

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:48.540
I don't even now this Iyami, er, I mean Hayami's face.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:49.920
How am I supposed to spot him?

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:54.340
Sounds like there's a Duel over there. Let's go.

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:56.800
H-Hey!

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:01.720
That's...!

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:11.690
I knew it...

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:15.730
Th-There's no way something in a picture can come true!

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:16.940
It's flat out impossible!

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:21.860
Attack the enemy Monster!

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:24.910
Sure-Kill First Grade Shot!!

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:31.960
See? Just as I said it would be.

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:36.500
You were fated to be buried in three turns.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:40.010
I captured all of it on the pictures I shot.

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:42.430
The future?

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:45.680
And they are sure to become reality!

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:48.140
These pictures...

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.890
He predicted the future?

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:52.850
He can control the future just like my big sis said!

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:54.560
Hey, you all right?! Hey!

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:56.940
Let's get him to a hospital!

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:57.570
Right!

00:11:57.570 --> 00:12:00.320
So he really was using a Number.

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:05.660
<i>Hey, you all right?!</i>

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:06.780
<i>Hey!</i>

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:11.660
Why are they Dueling like this?

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:19.880
Hey, wait!

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:22.590
Are you Hayami?

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:28.510
Why?! Why can't you just enjoy Dueling?

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:33.770
Duelists are supposed to be friends, so why do you need to go that far?!

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:34.900
Why?

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:39.480
Isn't that obvious? It's so I can obtain Numbers!

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:46.070
Unfortunately, that man earlier wasn't a Numbers holder.

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:47.950
But my search will continue!

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:51.620
So I can obtain all the Numbers in the entire world!

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.660
Doing so will produce even <i>greater</i> photos!

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:59.670
I'll continue shocking everyone all over the world by capturing unbelievable pictures of big scoops!

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:05.550
This guy's trying to gather the Numbers all on his own!

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:09.180
So you know about the existence of Numbers?

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.470
Could... Could you possibly...

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:12.560
Yeah, I have some!

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:15.310
I see! So you have Numbers!

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:17.940
I do! But I'll never let a guy like you-

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:25.450
I thought I told you to inform me the second you found him!

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:26.950
S-Sis!

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:31.950
Do you remember me, Shuuta Hayami?

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:37.460
Well, I guess I can't blame you for not remembering an amateur reporter like me.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:44.420
But I bet you remember the editor-in-chief of the Net News who rejected all of your pictures.

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:47.380
Oh, you bet I remember him.

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:52.640
He belittled me severely and told me, "News photos need to have a bigger impact"!

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:58.480
Well, now the editor-in-chief wants to enter a contract with you, bit I won't accept that.

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:01.360
There's no way I could ever acknowledge a guy who puts the lives of others in danger

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:05.110
just to be the first to capture pictures of a big scoop!

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:07.110
I put their lives in danger?

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:12.450
I'm shocked! I'm simply trying to capture "nice pictures"!

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:17.210
And you're using this weird power you got that lets you change the future to do so?

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:18.870
Lets him change the future?

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:22.540
You did this before, didn't you?

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:23.630
This incident.

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:27.380
You said something like, "The future will move as I command it to."

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:29.390
Oh yes, I can do that.

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:31.600
Using the power of the Numbers, anyway.

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:36.390
I suppose you won't believe it until you see it.

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:43.480
It sounds like the power of the Number this man is being controlled by has the power to control the future.

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:44.400
Control?

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:48.950
I'll give you these pictures, so please hurry and get out of the way.

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:52.530
I have no doubt that the editor-in-chief will be more than pleased with them!

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:53.870
Stop joking!

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:56.080
I don't see anyone joking.

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.620
I'm very busy.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:00.620
I need to Duel this guy over here, you see.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:04.460
Yuma, don't do it. You can't Duel with such a dangerous guy.

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:09.840
If you call yourself a reporter, surely you don't have the time to laze about here, right?

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:15.810
Oh yeah, I'll give you a little present that will give you another really big scoop!

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:17.850
This one may make you nauseous, though.

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:21.440
But it can't he helped, since you cornered me like this.

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:24.150
Kotori!

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:24.940
Kotori-<i>chan</i>!

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:28.650
Oh? Are you two by any chance acquaintances of this girl?

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:30.570
In that case, you had best hurry along.

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:36.740
An incident will occur soon, you see, where that blimp has a wee bit of engine trouble in the skies of Heartland City.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:44.170
That photograph there holds within it the coming of one of the largest scoops to ever strike this area to be caught on film.

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:49.630
And if it should happen... No, all of my photos are bound to become reality.

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:52.630
And you can bet Heartland City will be lead into a big panic.

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:54.800
How could you?

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:58.470
Now hurry along and show the editor-in-chief that picture.

00:15:58.470 --> 00:16:03.690
Once that picture of the incident hits the web, the entire world will feel its impact.

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:04.520
Stop this!

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:06.730
Don't do something so stupid!

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:09.070
"Stupid", indeed.

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.690
Kotori! Answer me, Kotori!

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:12.110
Hey, Kotori!

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:14.450
<i>Why are you contacting me now for?</i>

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:15.320
<i>What do you want?</i>

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.660
Where are you right now?

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:19.870
Somewhere you'll never find me, Yuma!

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:23.710
<i>Don't tell me... On the blimp?</i>

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:25.330
<i>Are you riding on that blimp?!</i>

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:26.670
Oh, you bet I am!

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:27.540
Why can't I?

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:28.920
<i>Are you all right?!</i>

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:31.340
Yup, I'm having a blast up here!

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:33.510
It feels good to look at that city like this.

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:36.430
Not that! I mean, is there anything out of the ordinary?

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:38.350
<i>Huh? Out of the ordinary?</i>

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:40.640
Kotori!

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:42.390
Hey, look over there!

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:48.940
The engine!

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.070
<i>What about the engine?</i>

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:54.400
Kotori!

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:56.780
You need to stop this at once!

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:58.160
Hurry and stop it!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:00.740
No can do, because this just became reality.

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:04.330
You were the one who made it reality, right?! Return it to normal!

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:06.000
Boy do you ever shock me.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:09.210
As a reporter, you should be jumping for joy right about now.

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:13.670
Who are reporters? They seek out scoops, right?

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:15.090
Now you've done it!

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:17.430
Hitting me won't change this reality.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:21.640
And while we waste our time like this, the blimp draws ever closer to its impending peril.

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:23.850
Yuma!

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:27.480
I'll do something about the blimp.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.860
Don't you dare take your eyes off this guy!

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:37.820
Finally that nagging pest's gone away.

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:39.410
So how about we begin?

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:40.620
Astral...

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:45.500
If the one being controlled by a Number loses the Duel and has the Number taken away,

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.120
they should return to normal, right?

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.040
Right.

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:54.300
Meaning if I beat this guy, the future depicted in that photo will disappear and Kotori will be safe, right?

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:56.760
Spot on. However...

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:57.970
Let's go, Shuuta!

00:17:59.010 --> 00:17:59.800
Let's Duel!

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:06.810
Duel Disk, set!

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:14.570
D-Gazer, set!

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:26.120
<i>AR Vision - Link established.</i>

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:29.250
Duel Target, locked on!

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.380
Wh-What the heck are you doing?!

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:35.630
I'm capturing your future on film!

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:44.140
See? Your future is depicted right here.

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:49.100
It shows you after you lose this Duel and have all your Numbers taken away.

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:52.190
The future shown in these pictures cannot be changed.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:58.650
My victory and your miserable defeat was decided the moment I flashed my shutter.

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:01.070
Cut the crap!

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:03.870
My future won't be decided by someone like you!

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:05.580
Duel!!

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.540
I'm taking the first turn!

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:09.500
My turn! Draw!

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:13.590
I set a Monster in face-down Defense Mode!

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:17.920
And I'll set a card face-down and end my turn!

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:20.380
My turn! Draw!

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:23.680
I Summon Scoop Shooter!

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:35.820
<i>The Monster Yuma set face-down in Defense Mode was Gogogo Golem.</i>

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:38.110
<i>It has 1500 Defense Points.</i>

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:42.820
<i>On the other side, Scoop Shooter has 1400 Attack Points.</i>

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:46.870
<i>If he attacks like this, the opponent will receive damage.</i>

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:50.830
I activate the Equipment Magic, Telephoto Lens, from my hand!

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:54.250
I equip Telephoto Lens to Scoop Shooter!

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:08.060
The Monster equipped with this card gains 400 Attack Power for each card in my hand.

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:10.020
I have four cards in my hand.

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:12.940
So it gains 1600 Attack Points!

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:14.810
<i>It's got 3000 Attack Points!</i>

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:20.940
<i>But it's okay. Gogogo Golem can't be destroyed by the opponent's Monster in battle once per turn.</i>

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:26.160
I then activate the Magic Card, Negative -> Positive Swap, from my hand!

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:31.910
This card forces a face-down Defense Monster to switch into face-up Attack Mode!

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:42.090
And their Attack Power is switched with their Defense Power!

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:43.090
What?!

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:47.550
Using Negative -> Positive Swap reduced my hand by one.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:51.730
So Scoop Shooter's Attack Power goes down 400 points.

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:53.480
A slight drawback...

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:56.230
But this will be more than enough.

00:20:56.900 --> 00:20:58.690
Go, Scoop Shooter!

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:01.400
Attack Gogogo Golem!

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:18.250
<i>We have urgent news.</i>

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:22.630
<i>It seems the blimp flying over Heartland City's skies is currently experiencing engine trouble.</i>

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:32.810
It'll be okay. I promise it'll be okay...

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:35.270
Yuma...

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:37.480
Wait for me, Kotori!

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:39.310
I promise I'll help you!

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:39.980
Not happening!

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:44.320
It's been decided! The picture you saw before was just the outcome,

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:47.910
but this entire Duel is depicted in these pictures here.

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:53.370
On the fifth turn, you will Summon No. 39, Aspiring Emperor - Hope,

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:57.710
and on the sixth turn, you will be defeated by <i>my</i> Number.

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:03.300
The future has been captured within these photographs!

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:06.720
And they will not fail to become reality!

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:23.110
<i>Someone gave me some water.</i>

00:22:23.480 --> 00:22:29.030
<i>So I was able to paint a rainbow with ease.</i>

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:34.950
<i>I want to become someone perfect.</i>

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:38.000
<i>But it's very difficult.</i>

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:41.590
<i>Even with me suffering,</i>

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:45.670
<i>I can't seem to grasp victory.</i>

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:48.470
<i>I want to bloom!</i>

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:52.930
<i>I must be having some kind of weird dream.</i>

00:22:52.930 --> 00:22:55.970
<i>But If I must fulfill this,</i>

00:22:56.470 --> 00:22:59.270
<i>Then I don't mind being laughed at for it.</i>

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:06.360
<i>Since it's because your limits are decided on your own.</i>

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:09.400
<i>I'll show it, overcoming it to tomorrow.</i>

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:13.870
<i>Ah, I'm aiming for the big blue sky.</i>

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:15.830
<i>For all of its glory.</i>

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:17.620
<i>The Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:23.000
<i>All of those countless flower petals</i>

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:26.050
<i>They came at the expense of</i>

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:29.630
<i>me being able to reach those heights.</i>

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:34.050
<i>Ah, even though I lost my way today,</i>

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:35.890
<i>I still yearn for it.</i>

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:38.180
<i>That Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:45.320
The future he created using the power of the Numbers...

00:23:45.320 --> 00:23:48.900
I'll lose this Duel and Kotori will perish on board the blimp...!

00:23:50.070 --> 00:23:51.700
Is there no way for us to win?

00:23:52.610 --> 00:23:53.320
If this keeps up...

00:23:53.320 --> 00:23:57.620
You're the one who said you decide your own future.

00:23:57.620 --> 00:24:01.870
If I can muster up the courage to bring it to 'em, I can change the future!

00:24:02.170 --> 00:24:04.130
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:04.130 --> 00:24:07.670
"Power To Open A Path To The Future! Hope Ray, The Lord Of Hope"

00:24:07.670 --> 00:24:09.590
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:24:10.220 --> 00:24:12.430
Let's review the Heart Pieces!

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:16.350
The pieces are all broken up and not all of them fit each other.

00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:20.020
The players decide how many pieces they bet!

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:24.600
I gotta hurry and collect five Heart Pieces so I can complete my heart!
